Description: This package extends the mizer framework to support multi-species size
    spectrum models (MSSM) with benthic coupling for structurally complex marine
    ecosystems. It introduces predation refuges and additional benthic resources,
    such as algae and detritus, which are not size-structured. The package supports
    flexible habitat structures and includes example parameters for a generic Caribbean
    coral reef system.
